/ActualText (A complete prompt set designed to create a consistent Mediterranean poolside jewelry campaign combining natural skin texture, strong sunlight, sculptural architecture, underwater photography and high-end editorial aesthetics.\r\n\r\nThe prompts are built to maintain the same visual language across the entire campaign while allowing each frame to have its own composition and photographic character.\r\n\r\nHOW TO USE\r\nFor the most consistent results, build each image using three parts:\r\n\r\n1\) Campaign Base Prompt\nDefines the model, jewelry, location, lighting and overall visual identity.\r\n\r\n2\) Scene Prompt\nDefines the pose, framing, camera angle and composition of each image.\r\n\r\n3\) Realism Lock  \r\nAdds photographic imperfections and helps prevent the polished AI-generated look.\r\n\r\nFor jewelry campaigns, using a real product image as a visual reference is strongly recommended.\r)
/K [1]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 540 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
endobj
