/ActualText (OVER THE SHOULDER\r\n\rThe woman is sitting inside the swimming pool directly beside a thick white architectural pool wall.\r The camera is positioned slightly behind her left shoulder at approximately eye level.\r Her wet upper back and shoulder dominate the lower foreground while she gently turns her head three-quarters toward the camera.\r She looks downward and slightly sideways with a calm, distant expression.\rHer wet brown hair is combed naturally backward and falls behind her shoulders.\r One large gold flower earring is completely visible and becomes the main visual focal point.\r Small irregular water droplets cover her cheek, neck, shoulder and upper back.\r The model is placed slightly left of center.\r A white pool wall creates a strong vertical geometric shape along the left edge while turquoise swimming pool water fills the right side of the frame.\r Clear blue sky appears softly in the upper background.\r Strong directional midday sunlight comes from the upper right, producing bright reflections on the jewelry and subtle shadows beneath the cheekbone and jaw.\r\nCamera: 85mm lens, f/2.2, ISO 100, 1/1600 sec.  \r\nShallow depth of field, realistic full-frame fashion photography and subtle analogue grain.\r\n\nQUIET PROFILE\r\nClose three-quarter side portrait of the same woman seated beside the swimming pool.\r Her torso turns slightly away from the camera while her face is shown in a clean side profile facing right.\r She gently rests the side of her face against one hand, with her fingertips touching her cheek and temple.\r Her expression is quiet, contemplative and slightly detached.\r Wet slicked-back hair reveals individual strands and natural irregularities.\r One oversized gold flower earring is clearly visible against her hair and jawline. \rSmall water droplets remain scattered across her cheek, shoulder and arm.\r The model fills the left half of the image while turquoise water occupies most of the right side.\r White geometric pool architecture remains softly blurred in the distance.\r Hard Mediterranean sunlight creates crisp but natural shadows and luminous skin.\r The gold earring catches small directional highlights.\r\nCamera: 85mm prime lens, f/2.  \r\nMedium close-up portrait with shallow depth of field and subtle analogue softness.\r\n\r)
/K [3]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 544 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
