/ActualText (ARCHITECTURAL PORTRAIT\r\nThe woman sits low inside a sculptural sunken white concrete pool lounge.\r The camera is positioned slightly above eye level and looks downward at a subtle angle.\r She leans forward onto a thick white architectural ledge with both arms loosely crossing in front of her. Her shoulders and face are directed toward the camera.\r She looks directly into the lens with a calm and confident neutral expression.\r Both matching gold flower earrings are visible.\r Her wet hair is pushed naturally behind her head.\r Fine water droplets cover her shoulders and forearms.\r Minimal taupe swimwear appears subtly beneath her arms.\r Large white architectural blocks surround her body, creating clean diagonal and rectangular shapes.\r Bright turquoise pool water occupies the upper part of the image.\r Strong Mediterranean sunlight produces crisp architectural shadows and warm highlights across the skin.\r Avoid perfectly symmetrical beauty lighting.\r Preserve subtle under-eye texture, pores, freckles and natural skin variations.\r\nCamera: 50mm lens, f/2.8.  \r\nSlightly elevated perspective with a medium-format editorial character.\r\n\r\n\nUNDERWATER EXHALE\r\n\rThe same woman is photographed fully underwater inside the turquoise swimming pool.\r Close-up portrait from upper chest to the top of her head.\r The camera is positioned horizontally underwater at face level.\r She floats vertically with her head tilted slightly backward and to one side. Her eyes are peacefully closed and her lips are gently parted as she exhales several naturally irregular air bubbles. Her wet brown hair floats softly behind her.\r One gold flower earring remains clearly visible and is subtly distorted by the surrounding water.\r Moving sunlight creates organic underwater caustic patterns across her forehead, cheekbones, neck, collarbones and chest.\r The water surface appears at the top of the frame with a distorted reflection of her head.\r Maintain realistic underwater color attenuation with turquoise and cyan tones while preserving believable warm skin undertones.\r Include subtle suspended particles, imperfect bubbles, slight chromatic aberration and natural underwater softness.\r\nCamera: Underwater housing, 35mm equivalent lens, f/4.  \r\nClose focus with realistic optical distortion.\r\n\r\n\nSURFACE GAZE\r\nFrontal underwater beauty portrait of the same woman.\r Her shoulders are directed toward the camera while her face tilts subtly upward toward the surface.\r Her blue-green eyes remain open and gaze above the camera rather than directly into the lens.\r Wet brown hair floats naturally around her head, moving predominantly toward one side.\r Both large gold flower earrings remain visible.\r Several irregular transparent bubbles drift across her forehead, nose and lips, including a few larger bubbles near her mouth.\r The surface of the swimming pool appears immediately above her forehead and creates a distorted mirrored reflection of her face.\r Strong moving caustic light produces luminous organic patterns across her forehead, cheeks, nose, neck and upper chest.\r Preserve realistic underwater details: slightly clumped eyelashes, wet eyebrows, visible pores and freckles, subtle redness around the eyes and imperfect refraction.\r\nCamera: 50mm underwater portrait lens, f/4.  \r\nCentral composition with realistic optical irregularities rather than perfect digital symmetry.\r\n\r\n\nUNDERWATER CLOSE-UP\r\n\rExtreme underwater close-up of the same model.\r The face fills almost the entire vertical frame.\r The crop includes her forehead, eyes, nose and lips while one gold flower earring enters softly from the lower edge.\r Some parts of the forehead and chin are intentionally cropped to create an intimate editorial composition.\r She gazes slightly upward past the camera with blue-green eyes.\r Her lips remain gently parted.\r Two larger transparent bubbles sit close to her lower lip while several tiny bubbles naturally cling to the skin near the nose and forehead.\r Strong underwater caustic light creates intricate bright patterns across the forehead, nose bridge, eyelids, cheeks and chin.\r Preserve extreme micro-detail: eyebrow hairs, eyelashes, pores, freckles, fine texture, slight redness and subtle skin irregularities.\r The gold flower earring sits slightly outside the focal plane, producing a warm golden blur.\r\nCamera: 85mm close-focus lens, f/2.8.  \r\nVery shallow underwater focus with subtle optical distortion, fine grain and slight color fringing.\r\n\n\nSUN-KISSED\r\n\rClose editorial portrait of the woman lying back on a minimal white poolside sun lounger.\r The camera is positioned above her left shoulder and angled downward toward her face.\r Her head tilts gently backward.\r Her eyes are completely closed and her lips remain naturally relaxed as she enjoys the strong summer sunlight.\r The side of her face and one gold flower earring dominate the composition.\r Wet brown hair spreads irregularly across the textured white lounger.\r Small water droplets remain on her forehead, temple, cheek, neck and collarbone.\r Direct midday sunlight produces a bright highlight across her cheekbone and nose while creating a believable shadow beneath her jaw and hair.\r A subtle sun flare catches the edge of the gold earring.\r Keep the composition tightly framed around the head, neck and upper shoulder.\r\nCamera: 85mm lens, f/2.4.  \r\nVery shallow depth of field, analogue fashion photography and natural Mediterranean daylight.\r\n\r\n)
